---
title: Butter Tofu Rice Cooker
servings: 2
course: dinner
tags: one-pan, vegetarian, high-protein, tofu, rice
source: https://www.instagram.com/reel/DSY_f5lkdoy/
prep time: 10m
cook time: 25m
---

In a #rice cooker{}, melt @butter{2%tbsp} and sauté @garlic clove{2}(minced) until fragrant, about ~{3%minutes}. Add @firm tofu{400%g}(pressed and cubed) and toss to coat in the butter. Stir in @soy sauce{1.5%tbsp} and mix to combine.

Add @long grain rice{200%g}(rinsed) and @water{500%ml} to the rice cooker with the tofu, stirring to distribute evenly. Close the lid and cook until the rice is tender and the tofu is hot through, about ~{25%minutes}. Fluff the rice and serve.
